## wip buffer
wip/

## Datasets, data generation
datasets/
data/
minetest-run*/

## Model weights and checkpoints
weights/

## External baseline repos + their checkpoints/venvs/generated assets (cloned/downloaded
## locally for zero-shot eval, not vendored source). Our own scripts directly under
## baselines/ (e.g. eval_oasis_zeroshot.py) ARE tracked -- only the external clones and
## generated artifacts are excluded. See baselines/ in the Table 1 reproduction plan.
## open-oasis (etched-ai/open-oasis @ f59deef, MIT) source IS vendored so every machine runs the
## same Oasis model code; its weights (download from HF Etched/oasis-500m), demo media and git dir are not.
baselines/open-oasis/*.safetensors
baselines/open-oasis/media/
baselines/open-oasis/sample_data/
baselines/open-oasis/.cache/
baselines/open-oasis/.git/
baselines/WorldMem/
baselines/checkpoints/
baselines/prompts/
baselines/*/outputs/
baselines/outputs_worldmem_validate/

## log files
*.log
*.out

## wandb local run cache (not source, regenerated per-machine)
baselines/wandb/

## run files
outputs/
local_outputs/

